            <description><![CDATA[<h2>LiveManager 1.6</h2>

<ul>
  <li><strong>The song list stays put.</strong> Scrolling down and double-clicking
      a song could make the list jump and play a different song than the one you
      clicked. It now plays what's under the cursor.</li>
  <li>Design refinements throughout, including album names shown as tinted
      pills.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
